# Network connectivity check target list
#
# 4-field format (with evaluation):
#   <host>, <port>, <expected>, <description>
#   expected: ok (expect reachable) / ng (expect unreachable) / - (no eval)
#
# 3-field format (backward compatible, no evaluation):
#   <host>, <port>, <description>
#
# <port>: TCP port number, or '-' for ping-only (no TCP check)
# Lines sharing the same host share one DNS + Ping check.
#
# ---- Public DNS servers (ping only) ----
8.8.8.8,      -, ok, Google DNS Primary (ping)
8.8.4.4,      -, ok, Google DNS Secondary (ping)

# ---- Web services ----
google.com,  443, ok, HTTPS
google.com,   80, ok, HTTP
google.com,   22, ng, SSH (should be blocked)

# ---- No evaluation (3-field style) ----
# example.com,  443, HTTPS check
# 192.168.1.1,    -, Default Gateway
